ss=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colors\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colors by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miquel_Muerto\" title=\"Miquel Muerto\">Miquel Muerto</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"letters\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Lettered by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/AndWorld_Design\" title=\"AndWorld Design\">AndWorld Design</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">September 9, 2020</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #9</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_11\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 11\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #11</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #10</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on September 9, 2020 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the tenth issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series, the final issue of the five-part <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_House_of_Slaughter_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The House of Slaughter (comic arc)\">The House of Slaughter</a></i> arc, and the tenth issue of the fifteen-part <i>Archer's Peak</i> saga.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<blockquote><p>When <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a>'s Handler forces a confrontation on the street of Archer's Peak, Erica must decide where her loyalties lie — to her employers, or to the people who need her?<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot\">Plot</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/John_Collins\" title=\"John Collins\">Principal Collins</a> calls for <a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Mahoney\" title=\"Sophie Mahoney\">Sophie Mahoney</a>'s family, and <a href=\"/wiki/Ms._Mahoney\" title=\"Ms. Mahoney\">her mother</a> gets ready to go inside. \n</p><p>In the forest, <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Sheriff Cavanaugh</a> tells the officers to pull aside the Parker family to tell them about their children, but not to let them do anything stupid and cause a scene. He will arrest <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a>, but he wants everyone sent home. Tommy tells the Sheriff that he should know that he didn't do this, and that the monsters could come back at any minute. <a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a> arrives, telling him to go to the school while he watches Tommy. As the Sheriff leaves, Tommy figures out that Aaron is from Erica's organization, and tells him that the monsters are no longer just attacking children. Aaron loads a syringe, and prepares to kill Tommy.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tam\" title=\"Tam\">Tam</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a> arrive at the school, but the policemen tell them to turn around and come back tomorrow. Erica and James leave the car and run up to the school, where the families refuse to leave. Erica demands information from Joe, and figures out that there are not only three new bodies, but children in the parking lot. She tells Joe to get the children away from there as fast as possible, and to have <a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Tim Cavanaugh\">Tim</a> take James deep into the school to hide. She then rushes to where Aaron was left, as families in the lot continue to argue.\n</p><p>Aaron drugs Tommy and pulls out a knife, but is blocked by Erica. She shouts to him that there are <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">five oscuratypes</span> in the woods and children in the parking lot, before passing Tommy off to Joe. Aaron realizes that the monsters will have grown with each kill, and three bodies are not enough to feed all of them. She tells him that while he and the order worry about the rules, real people are dying.\n</p><p>In the parking lot, a little girl playing with a paper plane spots the Oscuratypes. As Joe and Tommy return, Tommy desperately yells for someone to save the girl, as she is lifted into the air. With the adults unable to see the monsters, they simply see her float into the air and be ripped in half. Tommy saves his mother from getting hit by the Oscuratype, as everyone flees into the school. James tells Tim to get all the children inside immediately, which he reluctantly does, shepherding the families into the gymnasium. \n</p><p>Seeing the monsters and knowing they're in a blood frenzy, Aaron tells Erica to take James and <a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a> to draw the monsters into a trap while he fights the monsters. He tells her that she knows what the Order will do now that so many people have seen a monster attack, and to let him work. She tells Tommy that he's not going to fight them, as Aaron is killed by the Oscuratypes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Order_of_St._George\"><a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a> †</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Archer.27s_Peak\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Archer's_Peak\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Sheriff Joe Cavanaugh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Tim Cavanaugh\">Tim Cavanaugh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/John_Collins\" title=\"John Collins\">Principal John Collins</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ms._Mahoney\" title=\"Ms. Mahoney\">Ms. Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tam\" title=\"Tam\">Tam</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Monsters\">Monsters</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratype\" title=\"Oscuratype\">Oscuratype</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comic_guide\">Comic guide</span></h2>\n<table class=\"navbar mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Expand\" data-collapsetext=\"Collapse\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border: 1px solid #8c8c8c; background:transparent; border-radius:4px; text-align:center;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background: var(--theme-sticky-nav-background-color); border-radius:4px;\" align=\"left\"><div style=\"height:3px; margin:0px 0px 0px 3px\"><div style=\"font-size:8pt\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Comic_(SIKTC)\" title=\"Template:Comic (SIKTC)\">v</a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://something-is-killing-the-children.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Comic_(SIKTC)\">d</a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://something-is-killing-the-children.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Comic_(SIKTC)?veaction=editsource\">e</a></div>