es\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.previewsworld.com/Catalog/JUL200919\">SOMETHING IS KILLING CHILDREN #10 - PreviewsWorld</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:41:56+00:00"}